						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
				)
			)
			(property "Description" "Restricted speed: Standard Code Rule 105, GCOR 6.28: Movement on Other Than Main Track. This is the foundational rule governing most industrial tracks. It mandates that trains or engines must move at a speed that allows them to stop within half the range of vision short of a train, engine, car, stop signal, derail, or switch improperly lined. It also requires crew members to look out for track obstructions"
				(at -3.175 -4.445 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
